{"page":123,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:91","surah":5,"ayah":91,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا يُرِيدُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ أَن يُوقِعَ بَيْنَكُمُ ٱلْعَدَٰوَةَ وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ فِى ٱلْخَمْرِ وَٱلْمَيْسِرِ وَيَصُدَّكُمْ عَن ذِكْرِ ٱللَّهِ وَعَنِ ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ ۖ فَهَلْ أَنتُم مُّنتَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"With intoxicants and gambling, Satan seeks only to incite enmity and hatred among you, and to stop you remembering God and prayer. Will you not give them up?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"intends","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُوقِعَ","en_gloss":"cause","transliteration":"yūqiʿa","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْنَكُمُ","en_gloss":"between you","transliteration":"baynakumu","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعَدَٰوَةَ","en_gloss":"[the] enmity","transliteration":"l-ʿadāwata","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ","en_gloss":"and [the] hatred","transliteration":"wal-baghḍāa","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"through","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْخَمْرِ","en_gloss":"intoxicants","transliteration":"l-khamri","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْمَيْسِرِ","en_gloss":"and gambling","transliteration":"wal-maysiri","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَيَصُدَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"and hinders you","transliteration":"wayaṣuddakum","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ذِكْرِ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance","transliteration":"dhik'ri","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَعَنِ","en_gloss":"and from","transliteration":"waʿani","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"So will","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَنتُم","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مُّنتَهُونَ","en_gloss":"(be) the ones who abstain","transliteration":"muntahūna","verse_key":"5:91"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٩١","en_gloss":"(91)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:91"}]},{"verse_key":"5:92","surah":5,"ayah":92,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُوا۟ ٱلرَّسُولَ وَٱحْذَرُوا۟ ۚ فَإِن تَوَلَّيْتُمْ فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّمَا عَلَىٰ رَسُولِنَا ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Obey God, obey the Messenger, and always be on your guard: if you pay no heed, bear in mind that the sole duty of Our Messenger is to deliver the message clearly.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"And obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱحْذَرُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"and beware","transliteration":"wa-iḥ'dharū","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَوَلَّيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"tawallaytum","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"then know","transliteration":"fa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنَّمَا","en_gloss":"only","transliteration":"annamā","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَسُولِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlinā","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","en_gloss":"(is to) convey (the Message)","transliteration":"l-balāghu","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_gloss":"clearly","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","verse_key":"5:92"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٩٢","en_gloss":"(92)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:92"}]},{"verse_key":"5:93","surah":5,"ayah":93,"ar_uthmani":"لَيْسَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ جُنَاحٌ فِيمَا طَعِمُوٓا۟ إِذَا مَا ٱتَّقَوا۟ وَّءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ ثُمَّ ٱتَّقَوا۟ وَّءَامَنُوا۟ ثُمَّ ٱتَّقَوا۟ وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who believe and do good deeds will not be blamed for what they may have consumed [in the past] as long as they are mindful of God, believe and do good deeds, then are mindful of God and believe, then are mindful of God and do good deeds: God loves those who do good deeds.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the good deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جُنَاحٌۭ","en_gloss":"any sin","transliteration":"junāḥun","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِيمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":9,"ar":"طَعِمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they ate","transliteration":"ṭaʿimū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","en_gloss":"they fear (Allah)","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَّءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they believe","transliteration":"waāmanū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] good deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","en_gloss":"they fear (Allah)","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَّءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"and believe","transliteration":"waāmanū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","en_gloss":"they fear (Allah)","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"and do good","transliteration":"wa-aḥsanū","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":23,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"loves","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the good-doers","transliteration":"l-muḥ'sinīna","verse_key":"5:93"},{"pos":25,"ar":"٩٣","en_gloss":"(93)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:93"}]},{"verse_key":"5:94","surah":5,"ayah":94,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَيَبْلُوَنَّكُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِشَىْءٍ مِّنَ ٱلصَّيْدِ تَنَالُهُۥٓ أَيْدِيكُمْ وَرِمَاحُكُمْ لِيَعْلَمَ ٱللَّهُ مَن يَخَافُهُۥ بِٱلْغَيْبِ ۚ فَمَنِ ٱعْتَدَىٰ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ فَلَهُۥ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, God is sure to test you with game within reach of your hands and spears, to find out who fears Him even though they cannot see Him: from now on, anyone who transgresses will have a painful punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"5:94"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱ